TI  - GenDiabSec: A Federated Recurrent Neural Network with Multistage DNAGen and Blockchain for Secure Collaborative Diabetes Detection
PY  - 2025
T2  - Iranian Journal of Science and Technology - Transactions of Electrical Engineering
VL  - 49
IS  - 3
