TI  - Conjunctival microvascular alterations in dry eye disease: A comparative study of Sjögren’s and non-Sjögren’s subtypes
PY  - 2025
T2  - Taiwan Journal of Ophthalmology
VL  - 15
IS  - 4
SP  - 589
