TI  - Federated and Homomorphic Encryption-Enabled Lightweight Cryptography for Secure IoT Environments
PY  - 2025
T2  - IETACS 2025 - 2025 International Conference on Innovations and Emerging Technologies in AI and Communication Systems: Unifying AI and Communication for a Smarter Tomorrow
SP  - 1069
EP  - 1075
DO  - 10.1109/IETACS68750.2025.11385626
